# Customer Churn Analysis

## Question
Which customer attributes and billing patterns most strongly predict whether a subscription customer will churn, and how reliably can we identify at-risk accounts before they cancel?

## How to Run
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt
2. Open the notebook:
   jupyter notebook analysis.ipynb

## Headline Finding
Month-to-month contract status and short tenure are the strongest drivers of customer churn, while small monthly price differences alone have a weaker effect than contract commitment.


