Conclusion Cell Text:
Month-to-month customers with shorter tenure show substantially higher churn rates than long-term contract subscribers, making early retention outreach the highest-leverage focus. A key limitation of this analysis is that the dataset lacks post-signup product usage and customer support ticket logs, which may omit behavioral warning signs prior to cancellation. As a next step, we should integrate product engagement and support interaction features and evaluate a regularized gradient-boosted model using cross-validation.


